Imagenette images are not included in this repository. Imagenette is a subset
of ImageNet published by fast.ai (https://github.com/fastai/imagenette) under
the Apache License 2.0; the images themselves are subject to the ImageNet
terms of access. data/manifest.json lists the filenames used; run
scripts/build_data.py against your own download of imagenette2-160 to rebuild
the data directories.
